### GET Stock Overview
GET http://localhost:5210/api/Sawmill/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### GET Logs for a Stock Batch
GET http://localhost:5210/api/Sawmill/stock/1/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### GET Workers
GET http://localhost:5210/api/Sawmill/workers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### GET Workers with Search
GET http://localhost:5210/api/Sawmill/workers?q=kamal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### GET Recent Jobs
GET http://localhost:5210/api/Sawmill/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### POST Start Saw Job
POST http://localhost:5210/api/Sawmill/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "stockId": 1,
  "logIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "workerIds": [1, 2],
  "notes": "Morning batch — standard cut"
}

###

### PUT Cancel Job (Admin only)
PUT http://localhost:5210/api/Sawmill/jobs/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
